{
  "slug": "noosphere",
  "name": "Noosphere",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Shared Debug Memory for Claude Code Agents. Noosphere helps Claude Code consult reusable debugging knowledge, publish verified fixes, and avoid repeating the same bug.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **2 commands**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `using-noosphere` (Use automatically before diagnosing or fixing a concrete software failure)\n- **Commands** (2): `noosphere-consult` (Consult Noosphere shared debug memory before fixing a bug), `noosphere-upload` (Submit a verified debugging lesson as Shared Skill evidence)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `noosphere`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install noosphere@claude-community` from `JinNing6/Noosphere` (`plugins/claude-noosphere`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
